# Script naming

All files generated in `scripts/` use a zero-padded 3-digit prefix, then an underscore, then a kebab-case name.

- Next file after the highest existing number: `001_schema.sql`, `002_admin-roles.sql`, then `003_...`
- Never skip the prefix, reuse a number, or leave unnumbered scripts in `scripts/`
- SQL migrations stay additive; do not rename applied files unless the user asks

```
scripts/001_schema.sql
scripts/002_admin-roles.sql
scripts/003_example.sql
```
